# Triangular prism (unit size, centered)
# Triangle side = 1, length (Z) = 1, height = 0.866
# Lies on a rectangular face (bottom), apex edge on top.
# Use Scale 0.03 in Unity -> side 3cm, length 3cm.
o TriangularPrism
v -0.5 -0.4330127 0.5
v 0.5 -0.4330127 0.5
v 0.0 0.4330127 0.5
v -0.5 -0.4330127 -0.5
v 0.5 -0.4330127 -0.5
v 0.0 0.4330127 -0.5
vn 0 0 1
vn 0 0 -1
vn 0 -1 0
vn 0.8660254 0.5 0
vn -0.8660254 0.5 0
s off
f 1//1 2//1 3//1
f 4//2 6//2 5//2
f 1//3 4//3 5//3
f 1//3 5//3 2//3
f 2//4 5//4 6//4
f 2//4 6//4 3//4
f 1//5 3//5 6//5
f 1//5 6//5 4//5
